    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley have the pleasure to bring to the market this charming three bedroom bungalow set in a peaceful countryside location just minutes from Charleville town.\n\nThis detached property offers an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a family home with space, privacy and outstanding potential. Occupying a generous site of approximately 1 acre, the property enjoys uninterrupted rural views while benefiting from easy access to local amenities and major transport routes. The residence is conveniently situated adjacent to Charleville Golf Club and Charleville Rugby Club, combining the tranquillity of country living with the convenience of nearby recreational facilities and bustling town.\n\nAlthough requiring some modernisation, the property has been well maintained and offers an excellent canvas for a purchaser to create a contemporary family home.\n\nIdeally positioned in the sought-after Kiltoohig area, the property offers the perfect balance of rural tranquillity and accessibility. Charleville town is less than five minutes away, providing schools, supermarkets, cafs, restaurants and everyday services, while the N20 offers convenient access to Cork and Limerick.\n\nAccommodation comprises of entrance porch, hallway, living room, dining room, kitchen, utility, 3 bedrooms and family bathroom.\n\nOutside\n, the property stands on a mature, well maintained site surrounded by established trees and gardens, providing privacy and a pleasant rural setting.\n\n There is also a detached garage with roller door, garden shed to the side of the house along with a car port.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with the selling agent.\n\nEntrance Porch\n1.56m x 0.71 patio door\n\nHallway\n6.97m x 1.06m, 1.83m 3.19m Stira to attic, phone point, radiator, wall lights, power points\n\nLiving Room\n4.30m x 4.32m Carpet, stove, radiator, power points, TV point, wall lights\n\nDining Room\n4.30m x 3.09m Carpet, power points, TV point, radiator\n\nKitchen\n3.67m x 3.09m Built-in units, vinyl flooring, double oven, electric hob, power points, extractor fan, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher\n\nUtility Room\n1.45m x 1.49m Vinyl flooring, heating controls, shelving, access to rear\n\nBedroom 1\n3.65m x 3.76m Built-in wardrobe, radiator, power points\n\nStorage press\n1.45m x 0.62m Shelved\n\nBedroom 2\n3.73 m 3.08m New carpet, built-in wardrobe, radiator, power points\n\nHot press\n3.73m x 1.07m Shelved, electric immersion, access to bed 2 3 for storage\n\nBedroom 3\n3.92m x 3.65m Built-in wardrobes, wall lights, radiator, power points\n\nBathroom\n2.14m x 3.07m WC, WHB, bath, separate electric shower, radiator\n\nShed 1\n5.99, x 3.91m Roller door, side door, shelves, power point, light\n\nShed 2\n4.08m x 2.11m Lawnmower shed with ramp\n\nBoiler house\n1.44m x 1.03m\n\nCar port\nOutside tap, power point, light\n\n\nDirections\nP56 YV48\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
